<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading centered"><span class="eyebrow">How we work</span>
<h2>A clear path from idea to delivery.</h2>
<p>Our process keeps every project straightforward, collaborative and focused on what you need.</p>
</div>
<div class="process-list"><article class="process-step"><h3>Tell Us What You Need</h3>
<p>Let us know the service or project you need and share your requirements.</p>
</article>
<article class="process-step"><h3>Discuss Your Requirements</h3>
<p>We review your needs and discuss the best approach for your project.</p>
</article>
<article class="process-step"><h3>Get a Clear Quote</h3>
<p>Receive a clear quote based on the scope and requirements of your project.</p>
</article>
<article class="process-step"><h3>Planning &amp; Development</h3>
<p>We plan and work on your project using the appropriate tools and solutions.</p>
</article>
<article class="process-step"><h3>Review &amp; Approval</h3>
<p>Review the completed work and provide feedback where applicable.</p>
</article>
<article class="process-step"><h3>Delivery &amp; Support</h3>
<p>Receive your completed project and appropriate support or guidance.</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>

