<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading centered"><span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span>
<h2>Questions, answered clearly.</h2>
<p>Here are a few helpful details before you get started.</p>
</div>
<div class="faq-list"><details><summary>How do I request a quote?</summary>
<p>You can request a quote by completing our Request a Quote form or contacting ABKAB Smart Solution through WhatsApp, phone, or email.</p>
</details>
<details><summary>How long does a website project take?</summary>
<p>Project timelines depend on the scope and requirements. After reviewing your requirements, we will provide an estimated delivery timeline.</p>
</details>
<details><summary>Do you work with customers outside Kano?</summary>
<p>Yes. We can work with clients in Kano and other locations across Nigeria, depending on the service and project requirements.</p>
</details>
<details><summary>Do you provide support after project completion?</summary>
<p>Yes. Appropriate support and guidance can be provided after project completion depending on the service and agreed project requirements.</p>
</details>
<details><summary>How do payments work?</summary>
<p>Payment arrangements depend on the service and project scope. The payment terms will be discussed and agreed upon before work begins.</p>
</details>
<details><summary>Can I contact you directly before requesting a quote?</summary>
<p>Yes. You can contact us directly through WhatsApp, phone, or email to discuss your requirements before submitting a request.</p>
</details>
</div>
</div>
